{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "4a46f8d9-9e82-4f74-9f84-2f711adcad44",
    "name": "IRoute - Job Assign To Close Flow",
    "description": "# IRoute Job Assign To Close Flow\n\nManual E2E flow to validate driver mobile execution from assigned job pickup to close.\n\n## Import\n1. `IRoute_Job_Assign_To_Close_Flow_Collection.json`\n2. Your environment (or set variables in collection)\n\n## Precondition\n- Booking is already created and **assigned to this driver** from portal/admin side.\n- Driver can login in mobile API.\n- For COD shipments, payment flow (A9) is expected before A10.\n\n## Run order\n1. **00 Setup** - Login, Dashboard, Job Detail sync\n2. **01 Assigned Job Check** - Ensure assigned job is visible\n3. **02 Execute Core** - A1 to A7\n4. **03 COD (Optional)** - A9 for COD shipments\n5. **04 Close Job** - A8 then A10\n6. **05 Final Verify** - Job detail + timeline\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
